WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.541
Father...

00:00:06.041 --> 00:00:09.250
all my life, I have
answered every call...

00:00:10.583 --> 00:00:13.583
to honor, duty, to war.

00:00:17.666 --> 00:00:18.583
But now fate...

00:00:19.416 --> 00:00:21.291
has given me something
I never sought...

00:00:27.833 --> 00:00:28.625
a child...

00:00:30.875 --> 00:00:32.625
a life untouched by the storm.

00:00:35.416 --> 00:00:37.500
Lend me the strength of
the All-Fathers...

00:00:40.291 --> 00:00:42.208
so that I may fight
once more.

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:44.291
Defeat one more enemy

00:00:45.166 --> 00:00:47.000
and return home to her.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.208
Not as a warrior

00:00:49.666 --> 00:00:50.666
but as warmth.

00:00:51.666 --> 00:00:52.958
To teach her not battle

00:00:53.375 --> 00:00:54.375
but stillness.

00:00:55.083 --> 00:00:56.625
The kind I never knew.

00:00:57.083 --> 00:00:58.791
Please Father heed my words.

